== Useful Cards ==
* Cards which are not Skills but still provide {{KW2|Block}}, such as {{C2|Iron Wave}} or {{C2|After Image}}, can prevent damage without gaining {{BD2|Tainted}}.
* Expensive skills like {{C2|Reanimate}} or {{C2|Impervious}}, which provide significant benefits while only gaining {{BD2|Tainted}} once, tend to be more effective than cheaper skills like {{C2|Deflect}} or {{C2|Prepared}}.
* Decks which rely on skills like {{C2|Deadly Poison}} or {{C2|No Escape}} to kill enemies are generally not effective against this enemy, as it will be difficult to deal damage to the '''Infested Prism''' without taking additional damage yourself.

